stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Loading: Open review
    Loading --> Ready: Current evidence arrives
    Loading --> Disposed: Close review
    Ready --> Editing: Change choices or reason
    Editing --> Submitting: Save review
    Ready --> Submitting: Save review
    Submitting --> Conflict: Card changed
    Conflict --> Reloading: Review updated card
    Reloading --> Ready: Fresh evidence reconciles visible choices
    Reloading --> Conflict: Reload fails
    Reloading --> Disposed: Leave the page
    Submitting --> Uncertain: Confirmation unavailable
    Uncertain --> Submitting: Retry same review request
    Submitting --> Done: Server confirms
    Ready --> Disposed: Close review
    Editing --> Disposed: Close review
    Done --> Disposed: Close review
    Disposed --> [*]
    %% never Submit an observation absent from the current visible evidence.
    %% never Submit a decision unavailable in the current operation.
    %% never Retry or submit without an explicit user action.
